1:["$","$Ld",null,{"page":{"id":"phase-1--1d-get-comfortable","kind":"phase-article","route":"/roadmap/phase-1/1d-get-comfortable","sourceUrl":"https://refold.la/roadmap/phase-1/1d-get-comfortable","sourceHash":"6300de361f33707c285b6d779d4a8944fac728082acc8399c5e2c20358489628","collectedAt":"2026-09-01T23:11:40.993Z","bodyMode":"authorized-full-body","title":{"en":"1D — Get Comfortable","zh":"1D——适应并熟练起来"},"description":{"en":"","zh":""},"segments":[{"id":"what-youre-doing","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"What You're Doing","zh":"你正在做什么"}},{"id":"segment-0002","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"You can understand basic sentences and you're immersing consistently every day. Now it's time to settle into your routine, build up your comfort, and increase your \"language stamina\" before taking the next leap into Phase 2.","zh":"你已经能够理解基础句子，并且每天持续进行沉浸。现在是时候稳定你的日常安排、逐步建立舒适感，并提升“语言耐力”，为下一步进入第二阶段做好准备。"}},{"id":"segment-0003","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"The goal here isn't to learn dramatically new things — it's to solidify what you're already doing, increase your daily time, and reach 1000 words. By the end of this sub-phase, you should feel like you know what you're doing and are ready for the next level.","zh":"这里的目标不是学习大量全新的内容，而是巩固你已经在做的事情、增加每天的学习时间，并达到1000词。到这个子阶段结束时，你应该会觉得自己已经知道该怎么学习，并准备好进入下一个层级。"}},{"id":"whats-new","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"What's New","zh":"有什么新内容"}},{"id":"segment-0005","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Everything from 1C continues. The one major addition is a new type of immersion (and it's optional):","zh":"1C中的所有内容都会继续。唯一重要的新增内容是一种新的沉浸类型（可选）："}},{"id":"segment-0006","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"<strong>Freeflow Immersion</strong> — Up until now, all your immersion has been interactive: pausing, looking things up, actively working to understand. Freeflow immersion is closer to what you do in your native language — you focus on the content (the story, the information) and let understanding happen naturally, without stopping to look things up. <a href=\"/roadmap/library/freeflow-immersion\">Freeflow Immersion</a>","zh":"<strong>自由流沉浸</strong>——到目前为止，你的沉浸都是互动式的：暂停、查词，并主动努力去理解。自由流沉浸更接近你使用母语时的方式——专注于内容（故事、信息），让理解自然发生，而不因查词而停下来。<a href=\"/roadmap/library/freeflow-immersion\">自由流沉浸</a>"}},{"id":"segment-0007","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"You won't understand much during freeflow, especially with new material. That's expected. The point is to practice processing the language at natural speed and to enjoy the experience. It's a lot like climbing with a harness — you're still doing the work of trying to understand, but if you lose track, your existing knowledge of the story catches you.","zh":"在自由流沉浸中，你不会理解太多，尤其是面对新材料时。这是正常的。重点是练习以自然速度处理语言，并享受过程。这很像系着安全绳攀岩——你仍在努力理解，但如果跟不上，已有的故事知识会帮助你重新跟上。"}},{"id":"segment-0008","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"For freeflow to be effective at this level, use content you've already gone through interactively. The Multipass Method is ideal here: use something for interactive immersion first, then go back and use it for freeflow. Re-experiencing familiar content also works well — dubbed audiobooks, shows you know, etc. <a href=\"/roadmap/library/the-multipass-method\">The Multipass Method</a> <a href=\"/roadmap/library/re-experiencing-content\">Re-experiencing Content</a>","zh":"要让自由流沉浸在这一水平上有效，请使用你已经进行过互动学习的内容。多遍学习法非常适合这种情况：先用内容进行互动沉浸，再回头用它进行自由流沉浸。重新体验熟悉内容也很有效——配音有声书、你熟悉的剧集等。<a href=\"/roadmap/library/the-multipass-method\">多遍学习法</a> <a href=\"/roadmap/library/re-experiencing-content\">重新体验内容</a>"}},{"id":"segment-0009","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"<strong>Don't drastically change your routine.</strong> If you need variety, try new content or a new genre rather than overhauling your approach. This sub-phase is about building consistency and increasing your daily time, not reinventing your process.","zh":"<strong>不要彻底改变你的日常安排。</strong>如果需要变化，尝试新内容或新类型，而不是彻底推翻现有方法。这个子阶段的重点是建立一致性并增加每天的学习时间，而不是重新发明你的学习流程。"}},{"id":"segment-0010","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"If you're happy using just Interactive Immersion, you could forgo Freeflow immersion entirely at this stage and still be perfectly fine.","zh":"如果你只使用互动沉浸就已经很满意，那么现阶段完全可以不进行自由流沉浸，也不会有问题。"}},{"id":"your-routine","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"Your Routine","zh":"你的日常安排"}},{"id":"segment-0012","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Now that you're using all three types of learning activity — priming, interactive immersion, and freeflow immersion — your breakdown shifts: <a href=\"/roadmap/library/the-pillars-of-language-learning\">The Pillars of Language Learning</a>","zh":"现在你已经在使用三种学习活动——预热学习、互动沉浸和自由流沉浸——因此时间分配会变为：<a href=\"/roadmap/library/the-pillars-of-language-learning\">语言学习的支柱</a>"}},{"id":"segment-0013","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"en":"<strong>Priming:</strong> 25%","zh":"<strong>预热学习：</strong>25%"},{"en":"<strong>Interactive Immersion:</strong> 50%+","zh":"<strong>互动沉浸：</strong>50%以上"},{"en":"<strong>Freeflow Immersion:</strong> 25%-","zh":"<strong>自由流沉浸：</strong>25%以下"}]},{"id":"segment-0014","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Interactive immersion is still the most important. If you have to cut something short, don't let it be that.","zh":"互动沉浸仍然是最重要的。如果必须缩短某项活动，不要缩短它。"}},{"id":"segment-0015","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"This is also a good time to start increasing your total daily time. If you've been doing 1 hour, try pushing toward 1.5 hours.","zh":"现在也是开始增加每天总学习时间的好时机。如果你一直学习1小时，可以尝试增加到1.5小时左右。"}},{"id":"sample-daily-schedule","type":"heading","level":3,"content":{"en":"Sample Daily Schedule","zh":"每日安排示例"}},{"id":"segment-0017","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"en":"Vocab study: 20-25 mins","zh":"词汇学习：20至25分钟"},{"en":"Interactive Reading with Audio (TV show): 45 mins","zh":"带音频的互动阅读（电视剧）：45分钟"},{"en":"Freeflow Reading with Audio (comprehensible input or familiar content): 20-25 mins","zh":"带音频的自由流阅读（可理解输入或熟悉内容）：20至25分钟"}]},{"id":"when-to-move-on","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"When to Move On","zh":"何时进入下一阶段"}},{"id":"segment-0019","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Move to Phase 2 when you:","zh":"当你满足以下条件时，进入第二阶段："}},{"id":"segment-0020","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"en":"Are hitting your daily learning goals consistently","zh":"持续达到每天的学习目标"},{"en":"Know at least 1000 words","zh":"至少掌握1000个词"},{"en":"Can understand sentences in the immersion materials you're using. <ul><li>Try this test: open a simple TV show with subtitles. At least 1 in 4 sentences should be understandable without tools, about 2 in 4 with tools, and about 1 in 4 will still be too difficult. <em>~75% sentence coverage.</em></li></ul>","zh":"能够理解所使用沉浸材料中的句子。<ul><li>试试这个测试：打开一部带字幕的简单电视剧。至少每4个句子中有1个无需工具即可理解，约有2个借助工具可以理解，仍有约1个过于困难。<em>约75%的句子覆盖率。</em></li></ul>"}]}],"cards":[]},"siteBasePath":"/my_learning_docs"}]
